  "description": {
    "text": "The Victory Battle was the Kamex Mega Battle's second tournament in 2016, held only on the first day of the Chiba tournament, 21 May 2016, at Makuhari Messe. Two straight wins in its Second Stage earned a Fighting Fury Belt, and the top three of each league won Victory Ring in gold, silver or bronze stamped with the event's logo, a place in the Japan Championship on 19 June and a place on day 1 of the 2016 World Championships' card game.",
